Follow `doc/tui-style-guide.md`. Use `theme::` tokens and component helpers instead
of `Color::` values. Pick glyphs only from the guide. Lower color-budget caps for
every migrated file; never raise a cap. Preserve visible text, keys, geometry,
and tab click regions.
